{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>And this calf came out.</b> It appears that he melted the gold in fire and poured it into a mold, and it came out fully formed all at once. And what did they see to make the form of a calf? One may say: from the moment they saw the Elohim of Israel, and the creatures — they were like the sole of a calf's foot; therefore they chose the likeness of a calf. And some say: he threw there a tablet upon which they had carried up the coffin of Joseph, upon which was written עלה שור etc."], :book :exodus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:04:28.732432209Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}